    "title_en": "Determining spin effects in global equilibrium by quantum kinetic theory",
    "abstract_en": "In this proceedings, we review the determination of spin effects in global equilibrium using quantum kinetic theory. Our discussion ranges from massless to massive fermions and from constant to varying electromagnetic fields. We find that by extending our consideration from constant to varying electromagnetic fields, previously indeterminate spin effects induced by vorticity and electromagnetic fields can now be further pinned down.",
